# AI Processing

## Status
Not in the HTML prototype. Treat as **optional future** capabilities — do not block MVP parity.

## Allowed capabilities (when built)
| Capability | Input | Output |
|------------|-------|--------|
| Dekont OCR | receipt image | draft note + paidDate suggestion |
| Plan PDF parse | company ödeme planı PDF | draft installment list |
| Bank SMS match | SMS text | suggested installment + partner |

## Hard rules
- **Opt-in** only — never auto-run on every upload without user intent
- AI output is a **draft**; user must confirm before persist
- Never silently overwrite payments, shares, or totals
- Keep prompts/PII out of third-party logs where possible; document data flow
- Isolate AI in Application services behind interfaces for easy disable

## Anti-patterns
- Treating template marketing numbers as ground truth without validation
- Auto-settlement or auto-mark-paid from AI confidence scores alone
